{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure and conquer mighty kingdoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Castle Crumble, your goal is clear\u2014castles must fall. Fulfill the dream of reducing towering fortresses to dust in a fully simulated physics environment. Could destruction be relaxing? In Castle Crumble it can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/01_eng.png?t=1743598828\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/cc_01_booster.gif?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of tools to bring down castles in different ways. For even greater firepower, equip boosters and unleash true destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/02_eng.png?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/cc_02_chain_effect.gif?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every move counts. Use your limited ammo wisely, set up chain reactions, and watch as multi-staged castles crumble before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/03_eng.png?t=1743598828\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/cc_03_explosion.gif?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each brick and wooden beam is individually simulated, allowing for dynamic and unpredictable destruction. Knock towers onto other buildings or trigger placed explosives with flying rubble for spectacular results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/04_eng.png?t=1743598828\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/cc_04_castle.gif?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Castle Crumble, featuring unique and beautiful landscapes. From dense jungles to scorching deserts and serene coastal islands, each kingdom offers new challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to strategize, demolish, and conquer in Castle Crumble\u2014where every collapse is a victory!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562340?t=1743598828","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/bb8d54e383dc0ecd58f0b02e23fc7b22d5124f2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743598828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/4b4f60164d9f896b090264765e3e39ec01592057/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743598828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/4b4f60164d9f896b090264765e3e39ec01592057/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743598828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an adventure and conquer mighty kingdoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Castle Crumble, your goal is clear\u2014castles must fall. Fulfill the dream of reducing towering fortresses to dust in a fully simulated physics environment. Could destruction be relaxing? In Castle Crumble it can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/01_eng.png?t=1743598828\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/cc_01_booster.gif?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a variety of tools to bring down castles in different ways. For even greater firepower, equip boosters and unleash true destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/02_eng.png?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/cc_02_chain_effect.gif?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every move counts. Use your limited ammo wisely, set up chain reactions, and watch as multi-staged castles crumble before your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/03_eng.png?t=1743598828\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/cc_03_explosion.gif?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each brick and wooden beam is individually simulated, allowing for dynamic and unpredictable destruction. Knock towers onto other buildings or trigger placed explosives with flying rubble for spectacular results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/04_eng.png?t=1743598828\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/extras/cc_04_castle.gif?t=1743598828\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world of Castle Crumble, featuring unique and beautiful landscapes. From dense jungles to scorching deserts and serene coastal islands, each kingdom offers new challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to strategize, demolish, and conquer in Castle Crumble\u2014where every collapse is a victory!</p>","developers":["Orbital Knight"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562340/c1ab635ce609ab40b5668adbe774ba7611dc465c/header.jpg?t=1743598828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (M1)</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257120865,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120865/movie480.mp4?t=1743496436","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120865/movie_max.mp4?t=1743496436"},"name":"Castle Crumble Is Coming","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120865/ac5078c161d8ed9ac5dbe968cd8f1d2eb335e9de/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743496436","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120865/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743496436","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257120865/movie_max_vp9.w